    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6afdd649d8fb60.17805653\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The Auction House minimum deposit has finally been reduced back down to 1 Copper.<br><br>It's been almost two weeks since launch and over a week since <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/minimum-deposit-on-ah-being-reduced-to-1-copper-soon-in-wow-forever-383786\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Blizzard announced</a> that the Auction House deposit would be changing. With the weekly reset, the change is finally here! The Auction House no longer requires a minimum deposit of 1 Silver for every item.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309602.png\" id=\"1309602\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309602.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Minimum Deposit\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.47248 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>For the faction-specific auction houses, the deposit should now strictly follow this formula:<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"exclude-units grid\" style=\"width: 800px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Duration</b></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Deposit Cost</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2 Hours</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5% of Vendor Price</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8 Hours</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20% of Vendor Price</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24 Hours</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">60% of Vendor Price</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br><br>This is a great change for the cheaper materials in the early levels, as players won't be putting up a deposit more than the items are worth!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>The Auction House minimum deposit has finally been reduced back down to 1 Copper.<br /><br />It's been almost two weeks since launch and over a week since <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/minimum-deposit-on-ah-being-reduced-to-1-copper-soon-in-wow-forever-383786\">Blizzard announced</a> that the Auction House deposit would be changing. With the weekly reset, the change is finally here! The Auction House no longer requires a minimum deposit of 1 Silver for every item.<br /><br />For the faction-specific auction houses, the deposit should now strictly follow this formula:<br /><br /><table><tr><td><b>Duration</b></td><td><b>Deposit Cost</b></td></tr><br /><tr><td>2 Hours</td><td>5% of Vendor Price</td></tr><br /><tr><td>8 Hours</td><td>20% of Vendor Price</td></tr><br /><tr><td>24 Hours</td><td>60% of Vendor Price</td></tr></table><br /><br />This is a great change for the cheaper materials in the early levels, as players won't be putting up a deposit more than the items are worth!</noscript>            \n        ",
