    "title": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Continuing to Break Records With Over 15 Million Characters Created",
      "es": "WoW: Sigue batiendo récords, con más de 15 millones de personajes creados"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Continuing to Break Records With Over 15 Million Characters Created...",
      "es": "WoW: Sigue batiendo récords, con más de 15 millones de personajes creados..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6afdd78b7f70b7.98560029\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">WoW: Forever continues to break records with over 15 million characters created and almost 1.5 billion quests completed.<br><br>Announced <a href=\"https://x.com/Warcraft/status/2122842235263680581\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">on X (Twitter)</a>, Blizzard announced some brand new statistics for the first two weeks of WoW: Forever's launch.<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Characters Created: 15,160,147</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Quests Completed: 1,480,343,357</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Enemies Defeated: 9,786,925,806</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Guilds Created: 140,764</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Camping Items Used: 28,696,386</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Parties Formed: 71,309,889</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Deadlist Boss: <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=4275/archmage-arugal\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Archmage Arugal</span></a> (Shadowfang Keep)</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">PvP kill: 28,938,569s</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Players Deaths: 196,851,761</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309485.jpg\" id=\"1309485\"><img width=\"250\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309485.jpg?maxWidth=250\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.75 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309486.jpg\" id=\"1309486\"><img width=\"250\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309486.jpg?maxWidth=250\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.75 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309487.jpg\" id=\"1309487\"><img width=\"250\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309487.jpg?maxWidth=250\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.75 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Holly Longdale also announced on Twitter that there are more people playing Forever weekly than seen in WoW in 15 years!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2122843024791314913\">Tweet #2122843024791314913</a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>WoW: Forever continues to break records with over 15 million characters created and almost 1.5 billion quests completed.<br /><br />Announced <a href=\"https://x.com/Warcraft/status/2122842235263680581\" rel=\"nofollow\">on X (Twitter)</a>, Blizzard announced some brand new statistics for the first two weeks of WoW: Forever's launch.<br /><br /><ul><li>Characters Created: 15,160,147</li><li>Quests Completed: 1,480,343,357</li><li>Enemies Defeated: 9,786,925,806</li><li> Guilds Created: 140,764</li><li>Camping Items Used: 28,696,386</li><li>Parties Formed: 71,309,889</li><li>Deadlist Boss: <a href=\"/forever/npc=4275/archmage-arugal\">Archmage Arugal</a> (Shadowfang Keep)</li><li>PvP kill: 28,938,569s</li><li>Players Deaths: 196,851,761</li></ul><br /><br />Holly Longdale also announced on Twitter that there are more people playing Forever weekly than seen in WoW in 15 years!<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
